---
import Page from '../../../layouts/Page.astro';
---
<Page
  title="Privacy Policy — InsureAlgo by CloudAlgo"
  description="InsureAlgo stores all data on your device. We collect zero personal data — no account, no tracking, no servers. Read the full privacy policy for InsureAlgo by CloudAlgo."
  canonicalURL="https://cloudalgo.com/apps/insurealgo/privacy"
>

<div class="pp-page">

  <main class="pp-main">

    <div class="pp-eyebrow">
      <span class="pp-eyebrow-dot"></span>
      Legal
    </div>

    <h1 class="pp-h1">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="pp-meta">
      InsureAlgo by CloudAlgo &nbsp;·&nbsp; Last updated: May 29, 2025 &nbsp;·&nbsp; Effective immediately
    </p>

    <!-- TL;DR -->
    <div class="pp-summary">
      <div class="pp-summary-label">The short version</div>
      <ul class="pp-summary-list">
        <li>
          <span class="pp-check">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 10 10" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="1.5,5 4,7.5 8.5,2.5" fill="none" stroke="white" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
          </span>
          InsureAlgo stores all your data on your device only
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="pp-check">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 10 10" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="1.5,5 4,7.5 8.5,2.5" fill="none" stroke="white" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
          </span>
          We collect zero personal data — no account, no tracking, no servers
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="pp-check">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 10 10" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="1.5,5 4,7.5 8.5,2.5" fill="none" stroke="white" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
          </span>
          No ads, no analytics, no third-party SDKs of any kind
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="pp-check">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 10 10" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="1.5,5 4,7.5 8.5,2.5" fill="none" stroke="white" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
          </span>
          Optional iCloud backup goes directly to your personal Apple account
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <!-- Section 1 -->
    <div class="pp-section">
      <div class="pp-section-header">
        <span class="pp-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 2L3 6v6c0 5.25 3.75 10.15 9 11.35C17.25 22.15 21 17.25 21 12V6l-9-4z"/></svg>
        </span>
        <h3>What data we collect</h3>
      </div>
      <p><strong>Nothing.</strong> InsureAlgo does not collect, transmit, or store any data on external servers.</p>
      <p>All information you enter — policy details, vehicle information, documents, reminders, and settings — is stored exclusively in your device's local storage. It never leaves your device unless you explicitly use the iCloud backup feature.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Section 2 -->
    <div class="pp-section">
      <div class="pp-section-header">
        <span class="pp-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M19.35 10.04A7.49 7.49 0 0 0 12 4C9.11 4 6.61 5.64 5.36 8.04A5.994 5.994 0 0 0 0 14c0 3.31 2.69 6 6 6h13c2.76 0 5-2.24 5-5 0-2.64-2.05-4.78-4.65-4.96z"/></svg>
        </span>
        <h3>iCloud Backup</h3>
      </div>
      <p>If you use the optional Backup &amp; Restore feature, your policy data is uploaded to <strong>your personal iCloud account</strong> under your own Apple ID.</p>
      <ul class="pp-list">
        <li><span class="pp-bullet"></span>The backup file is stored in your private iCloud Drive storage</li>
        <li><span class="pp-bullet"></span>CloudAlgo and InsureAlgo have no access to your iCloud data</li>
        <li><span class="pp-bullet"></span>You can delete backups at any time via the iOS Files app</li>
        <li><span class="pp-bullet"></span>Apple's privacy policy governs iCloud storage — see <a href="https://www.apple.com/legal/privacy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="pp-link">apple.com/legal/privacy</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <!-- Section 3 -->
    <div class="pp-section">
      <div class="pp-section-header">
        <span class="pp-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 1L3 5v6c0 5.55 3.84 10.74 9 12 5.16-1.26 9-6.45 9-12V5l-9-4zm0 10.99h7c-.53 4.12-3.28 7.79-7 8.94V12H5V6.3l7-3.11v8.8z"/></svg>
        </span>
        <h3>Permissions we request</h3>
      </div>
      <p>InsureAlgo requests only the permissions listed below, each only when you use the relevant feature:</p>
      <ul class="pp-list">
        <li><span class="pp-bullet"></span><strong>Notifications</strong> — to deliver the renewal reminders you configure in Settings</li>
        <li><span class="pp-bullet"></span><strong>Face ID / Touch ID</strong> — to protect your data with biometric lock (optional)</li>
        <li><span class="pp-bullet"></span><strong>Camera</strong> — to photograph insurance documents and attach them to policies</li>
        <li><span class="pp-bullet"></span><strong>Photo Library</strong> — to select existing document images from your photo library</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="pp-note">None of these permissions result in data being transmitted externally. All captured content stays on your device.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Section 4 -->
    <div class="pp-section">
      <div class="pp-section-header">
        <span class="pp-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 2C6.48 2 2 6.48 2 12s4.48 10 10 10 10-4.48 10-10S17.52 2 12 2zm-2 15l-5-5 1.41-1.41L10 14.17l7.59-7.59L19 8l-9 9z"/></svg>
        </span>
        <h3>Third-party services</h3>
      </div>
      <p>InsureAlgo contains <strong>no advertising SDKs, no analytics libraries, and no third-party tracking</strong> of any kind.</p>
      <p>The app has no backend server, no user accounts, and makes no network requests — except for the optional iCloud backup described above.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Section 5 -->
    <div class="pp-section">
      <div class="pp-section-header">
        <span class="pp-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M18 8h-1V6c0-2.76-2.24-5-5-5S7 3.24 7 6v2H6c-1.1 0-2 .9-2 2v10c0 1.1.9 2 2 2h12c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2V10c0-1.1-.9-2-2-2zm-6 9c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2s.9-2 2-2 2 .9 2 2-.9 2-2 2zm3.1-9H8.9V6c0-1.71 1.39-3.1 3.1-3.1 1.71 0 3.1 1.39 3.1 3.1v2z"/></svg>
        </span>
        <h3>Data security</h3>
      </div>
      <p>Your data is stored using <strong>Hive</strong>, an encrypted on-device database. The optional biometric lock (Face ID / Touch ID) adds an additional layer of protection so only you can open the app.</p>
      <p>Since no data is transmitted to any server, there is no risk of a server-side breach affecting your policy information.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Section 6 -->
    <div class="pp-section">
      <div class="pp-section-header">
        <span class="pp-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M16 11c1.66 0 2.99-1.34 2.99-3S17.66 5 16 5c-1.66 0-3 1.34-3 3s1.34 3 3 3zm-8 0c1.66 0 2.99-1.34 2.99-3S9.66 5 8 5C6.34 5 5 6.34 5 8s1.34 3 3 3zm0 2c-2.33 0-7 1.17-7 3.5V19h14v-2.5c0-2.33-4.67-3.5-7-3.5zm8 0c-.29 0-.62.02-.97.05 1.16.84 1.97 1.97 1.97 3.45V19h6v-2.5c0-2.33-4.67-3.5-7-3.5z"/></svg>
        </span>
        <h3>Children's privacy</h3>
      </div>
      <p>InsureAlgo is rated <strong>4+</strong> on the Apple App Store and is appropriate for all ages. We do not knowingly collect any personal information from anyone, including children under 13.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Section 7 -->
    <div class="pp-section">
      <div class="pp-section-header">
        <span class="pp-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M19 3h-4.18C14.4 1.84 13.3 1 12 1c-1.3 0-2.4.84-2.82 2H5c-1.1 0-2 .9-2 2v14c0 1.1.9 2 2 2h14c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2V5c0-1.1-.9-2-2-2zm-7 0c.55 0 1 .45 1 1s-.45 1-1 1-1-.45-1-1 .45-1 1-1zm2 14H7v-2h7v2zm3-4H7v-2h10v2zm0-4H7V7h10v2z"/></svg>
        </span>
        <h3>Changes to this policy</h3>
      </div>
      <p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Changes will be reflected on this page with an updated "Last updated" date. Continued use of InsureAlgo after any changes constitutes your acceptance of the updated policy.</p>
      <p>Because we collect no personal data, updates will typically reflect only new app features or permissions — not new data-collection practices.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Limitation of Liability -->
    <div class="pp-liability">
      <div class="pp-liability-label">Limitation of Liability &amp; Disclaimer</div>
      <p>InsureAlgo is provided <strong>"as is"</strong> and <strong>"as available"</strong> without warranties of any kind, express or implied. CloudAlgo and the InsureAlgo developer expressly disclaim all liability for any direct, indirect, incidental, consequential, or special damages arising out of or in connection with your use of the application, including but not limited to: missed policy renewals, incorrect expiry data, data loss, notification failures, or reliance on any information stored in the app.</p>
      <p>InsureAlgo is a personal organisational tool designed to help you track insurance policy dates. <strong>It is not an insurance broker, agent, or advisor.</strong> You remain solely responsible for verifying the accuracy of your policy information directly with your insurance provider, and for ensuring your policies are renewed on time.</p>
      <p>CloudAlgo's total liability to you for any claim arising from your use of InsureAlgo shall not exceed zero (£0 / $0 / ₹0), as the application is offered entirely free of charge.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Contact -->
    <div class="pp-contact">
      <div class="pp-contact-left">
        <span class="pp-contact-title">Questions about this policy?</span>
        <span class="pp-contact-sub">We'll respond within 2 business days</span>
      </div>
      <a class="pp-contact-btn" href="mailto:contact@cloudalgo.com">
        contact@cloudalgo.com →
      </a>
    </div>

  </main>

</div>

</Page>

<style>
  /* ── Page wrapper ── */
  .pp-page {
    background: var(--ca-page-bg);
    min-height: 60vh;
  }

  .pp-main {
    max-width: 740px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 88px 24px 100px;
  }

  /* ── Eyebrow ── */
  .pp-eyebrow {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--ca-secondary-black);
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }

  .pp-eyebrow-dot {
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--ca-black);
  }

  /* ── Heading ── */
  .pp-h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3rem);
    font-weight: 900;
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    line-height: 1.1;
    color: var(--ca-black);
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .pp-meta {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 48px;
  }

  /* ── Summary card ── */
  .pp-summary {
    background: var(--ca-black);
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 28px 32px;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }

  .pp-summary-label {
    font-size: 0.6875rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-on-inverse-faint);
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .pp-summary-list {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 11px;
  }

  .pp-summary-list li {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 10px;
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--color-on-inverse-body);
  }

  .pp-check {
    width: 18px;
    height: 18px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--color-paper-a12);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    margin-top: 2px;
  }

  .pp-check svg {
    width: 10px;
    height: 10px;
  }

  /* ── Section cards ── */
  .pp-section {
    background: var(--ca-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--ca-border);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 28px 28px 24px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    box-shadow: 0 1px 4px var(--color-shadow-a06), 0 4px 16px var(--color-shadow-a05);
  }

  .pp-section-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }

  .pp-icon {
    width: 34px;
    height: 34px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    background: var(--ca-page-bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--ca-border);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .pp-icon svg {
    width: 16px;
    height: 16px;
    fill: var(--ca-black);
  }

  .pp-section h3 {
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--ca-black);
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  .pp-section p {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    color: var(--ca-secondary-black);
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .pp-section p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .pp-note {
    margin-top: 12px;
  }

  /* ── Lists ── */
  .pp-list {
    list-style: none;
    margin-top: 8px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  .pp-list li {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    color: var(--ca-secondary-black);
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 10px;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .pp-bullet {
    width: 5px;
    height: 5px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--surface-ghost);
    flex-shrink: 0;
    margin-top: 9px;
  }

  .pp-section strong {
    color: var(--ca-black);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .pp-link {
    color: var(--ca-black);
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 2px;
  }

  /* ── Liability card ── */
  .pp-liability {
    background: var(--ca-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--ca-border);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 24px 28px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    box-shadow: 0 1px 4px var(--color-shadow-a06), 0 4px 16px var(--color-shadow-a05);
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .pp-liability::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
    height: 3px;
    background: var(--ca-black);
    border-radius: 12px 12px 0 0;
  }

  .pp-liability-label {
    font-size: 0.6875rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }

  .pp-liability p {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--ca-secondary-black);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .pp-liability p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .pp-liability strong {
    color: var(--ca-black);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  /* ── Contact card ── */
  .pp-contact {
    background: var(--ca-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--ca-border);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 24px 28px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    box-shadow: 0 1px 4px var(--color-shadow-a06), 0 4px 16px var(--color-shadow-a05);
    margin-top: 40px;
    gap: 20px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .pp-contact-left {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 3px;
  }

  .pp-contact-title {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--ca-black);
  }

  .pp-contact-sub {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--ca-secondary-black);
  }

  .pp-contact-btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    background: var(--ca-black);
    color: var(--color-on-inverse);
    border-radius: 100px;
    padding: 10px 20px;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    white-space: nowrap;
    transition: opacity 0.2s;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .pp-contact-btn:hover {
    opacity: 0.8;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  /* ── Responsive ── */
  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .pp-main {
      padding: 72px 16px 80px;
    }

    .pp-h1 {
      font-size: 1.875rem;
    }

    .pp-summary {
      padding: 20px;
    }

    .pp-section {
      padding: 20px;
    }

    .pp-contact {
      padding: 20px;
    }
  }
</style>
